// P3.7 / PS21: the course's Funnel exercise (intro-to-part-studios.md PS21, `ex4-*`) through
// the UI, in inches and pounds. The numbers are asserted in `cadrs_core/tests/funnel.rs`
// (V 2.975 in³ against the course's 2.974, A 84.13 in² against 84.098, CoM (0.556, 0, −0.547),
// 0.098 lb and the inertia's Lxx 0.205, Lyy 0.518, Lxz −0.059 as `ex4-step18.png`:
// Polypropylene is 0.033 lb/in³, as Onshape's library, `ex4-step17.png`), and Sketch 1's full
// definition in `cadrs_core/tests/funnel_sketch.rs` (the sketch this scenario draws).
// PS21.7's direction: the Ø2.5 and Ø0.5 circles sit on the side away from the handle (−X), as
// the drawing shows; that is the variant whose CoM X is the screenshot's 0.556 (on +X it would
// be 0.778; the test builds both).
// 01 (PS21.1) Workspace units Inch / Pound; the document renamed "Funnel".
// 02 (PS21.2, ex4-step2) Sketch 1 on Top: the 6 × 4 ellipse, its offset 0.125 inside (the
//    rim; the 0.125 dimension between the two curves; the 6 above it and the 4 beside it), the
//    handle's three lines, a construction centreline from the origin to the end line's midpoint
//    (Coincident, Midpoint), the slanted lines Symmetric about it, the end line 1.5 long,
//    4.5 from the origin and 105° from the slanted line: fully defined (black).
// 03 (PS21.3) Extrude 1, the whole sketch, New, 0.125 in: the band and the handle.
// 04 (PS21.4, ex4-step4) Sketch 2 on the rim's bottom face (picked from the Bottom view): Use of
//    the rim's inner edge (an exact offset ellipse), offset 0.05 outwards into the rim.
// 05 (PS21.5, PS21.6, ex4-step5) the Lower Plane (Offset 3 in from Top, flipped down) and the
//    Middle Plane (Mid plane of Top and the Lower Plane), renamed in the feature list.
// 06 (PS21.7, PS21.8) Sketch 3 on the Middle Plane: Ø2.5 at x = −0.5; Sketch 4 on the Lower
//    Plane: Ø0.5 at x = −0.75.
// 07 (PS21.9, ex4-step9) Loft, Solid / Add: profiles "Faces of Sketch 2" (the disc and the 0.05
//    band, picked with the rim hidden), Sketch 3 and Sketch 4 (picked in the feature list);
//    Start and End Normal to profile, magnitudes 0.5 and 1.
// 08 (PS21.10, ex4-step10) Shell 0.05 in, the loft's top and bottom faces removed: it fails (it
//    would also shell the handle, joined to the loft): the title red with the reason, the loft
//    it shells tinted red with its edges red (P3.8: not the handle joined to it), the faces to
//    remove in the selection orange as in `ex4-step10.png`; ✓ keeps it (red in the list).
// 09 (PS21.11, ex4-step11) Loft 1 edited: the view is rolled back to it (Shell 1 isn't shown).
// 10 New: a separate part, still rolled back.
// 11 Final: the whole Part Studio as it will be, without the loft's preview: the Shell now
//    works (the thin cone). Accepted.
// 12 (PS21.12) Boolean Union, the loft first (Part 2 gives the result its properties).
// 13 (PS21.13) Fillet R0.5 on the handle's four vertical corners.
// 14 (PS21.14, ex4-step14) Sketch 5 on Front: the D-shaped bead (R0.125 arc on the handle's
//    top outer edge, closed by two vertical lines and a bottom line on the handle's bottom),
//    fully defined: the lines vertical and tangent to the arc, the bottom line level with the origin, the
//    arc's centre pierced by the handle's top outer edge; its fill over the handle translucent.
// 15 (PS21.15, X12, ex4-step15) Sweep Add, "Face of Sketch 5"; right-click → Select → Create
//    selection…, Edges, Tangent connected, the end's top edge clicked: its chain selected, 8
//    edges as Onshape's (the sliver OCCT's fillet leaves where the band's and the handle's top
//    faces meet is merged away, `brep::SLIVER`). The panel has only its ✕.
// 16 Add selection: the chain fills the Sweep path; the bead runs round the rim and handle.
// 17 (PS21.16) the spout: Extrude of the loft's bottom annulus (Bottom view), Add, 1 in down;
//    the depth arrow on the spout's end points down, the way it extrudes (fix round 1: a face
//    profile's arrow took +Z).
// 18 (PS21.17, PS21.18, ex4-step17/18) the part renamed "Funnel", Polypropylene, Mass and
//    section properties in inches and pounds. The panel reads Mass 0.098 lb, Volume 2.975 in³,
//    Surface area 84.127 in², CoM (0.556, ≈0 in scientific notation, −0.547) in, Lxx 0.205,
//    Lyy 0.518, Lxz −0.059 in² lb (the course: 0.098 lb, 2.974 in³, 84.098 in², (0.556,
//    −7.545e−5, −0.547), Lxx 0.205, Lyy 0.518, Lxz −0.059); values that would read 0.000 show
//    in scientific notation, as Onshape's.
// The fillet's corner edges are picked zoomed in, the two on the handle's far side from the
// Right and Back views (a vertical edge 0.125 in high is shorter than a vertex's pick circle);
// Sketch 2's band, under the rim, is picked with the rim hidden (shown again before 07);
// Sketches 3 and 4 in the feature list (a region click hits the first sketch plane along the
// ray).
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        // PS21.1: inches and pounds, the document's name.
        Click(ui("document-menu")),
        WaitFor("document-menu-popup"),
        Click(ui("document-menu-units")),
        WaitFor("workspace-units-dialog"),
        Click(ui("units-length")),
        Click(ui("units-length-option-3")),
        Click(ui("units-mass")),
        Click(ui("units-mass-option-2")),
        Click(ui("units-ok")),
        Click(ui("document-name")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("Funnel"),
        Key("Enter"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-inch-pound-funnel"),
        // PS21.2: Sketch 1 on Top.
        Click(ui("sketch")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        Click(ui("feature-top")),
        Key("N"),
        Click(ui("sketch-circle-caret")),
        WaitFor("sketch-variant-ellipse"),
        Click(ui("sketch-variant-ellipse")),
        ClickWorld(0, 0),
        ClickWorld(76.2, 0),
        ClickWorld(0, 50.8),
        Type("6"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Type("4"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Key("Escape"),
        // Its 6 above it and its 4 to its left, as ex4-step2.
        DragWorld(34.29, 0, 0, 62),
        DragWorld(0, 22.86, -88, 0),
        // The rim: the ellipse offset 0.125 inside.
        Key("O"),
        Click(world(38.1, 43.994)),
        MoveWorld(35, 40),
        Wait(2),
        Click(world(35, 40)),
        Type("0.125"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Key("Escape"),
        // The handle.
        Key("L"),
        ClickWorld(55.507, 34.803),
        ClickWorld(114.3, 19.05),
        ClickWorld(114.3, -19.05),
        ClickWorld(55.507, -34.803),
        Key("Escape"),
        Key("Escape"),
        // The horizontal construction centreline.
        Key("Q"),
        Key("L"),
        ClickWorld(0, 0),
        ClickWorld(114.3, 0),
        Key("Escape"),
        Key("Q"),
        Key("Escape"),
        // The slanted lines Symmetric about it.
        Key("Shift+Q"),
        Click(world(100, 0)),
        Click(world(84.9, 26.93)),
        Click(world(84.9, -26.93)),
        Key("Escape"),
        // The end line 1.5 long, 4.5 from the origin, 105° from the slanted line.
        Key("D"),
        Click(world(114.3, 10)),
        MoveWorld(126, 10),
        Wait(2),
        Click(world(126, 10)),
        Type("1.5"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Click(world(0, 0)),
        Click(world(114.3, -10)),
        MoveWorld(57, -62),
        Wait(2),
        Click(world(57, -62)),
        Type("4.5"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Click(world(114.3, 12)),
        Click(world(95, 24.22)),
        MoveWorld(103, 14),
        Wait(2),
        Click(world(103, 14)),
        Type("105"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Key("Escape"),
        ClickWorld(-110, 80),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-sketch-1-ellipse-rim-handle"),
        Click(ui("sketch-dialog-accept")),
        // PS21.3: Extrude 1, the whole sketch, 0.125 in.
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("Shift+E"),
        WaitFor("extrude-dialog"),
        Click(ui("feature-sketch-1")),
        Click(ui("extrude-depth-field")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("0.125"),
        Click(ui("extrude-dialog-title")),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-extrude-1-rim-and-handle"),
        Key("Enter"),
        // PS21.4: Sketch 2 on the rim's bottom face (picked from the Bottom view): Use of the
        // rim's inner edge, offset 0.05 outwards.
        Key("Shift+6"),
        Click(ui("sketch")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        Click(xyz(0, 49.2, 0)),
        Key("N"),
        Key("U"),
        Click(xyz(0, 47.625, 0)),
        Key("Escape"),
        Key("O"),
        Click(xyz(0, 47.625, 0)),
        Hover(xyz(0, 49.5, 0)),
        Wait(2),
        Click(xyz(0, 49.5, 0)),
        Type("0.05"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Key("Escape"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-sketch-2-use-and-offset"),
        Click(ui("sketch-dialog-accept")),
        // PS21.5: the Lower Plane.
        Click(ui("plane")),
        WaitFor("plane-dialog"),
        Click(ui("feature-top")),
        Click(ui("plane-offset-field")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("3"),
        Key("Tab"),
        Click(ui("plane-offset-flip")),
        Click(ui("plane-dialog-accept")),
        RightClick(ui("feature-plane-1")),
        WaitFor("feature-rename"),
        Click(ui("feature-rename")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("Lower Plane"),
        Key("Enter"),
        ClickAt(1500, 800),
        // PS21.6: the Middle Plane.
        Click(ui("plane")),
        WaitFor("plane-dialog"),
        Click(ui("plane-type")),
        Click(ui("plane-type-option-5")),
        Click(ui("feature-top")),
        Click(ui("feature-lower-plane")),
        Click(ui("plane-dialog-accept")),
        RightClick(ui("feature-plane-1")),
        WaitFor("feature-rename"),
        Click(ui("feature-rename")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("Middle Plane"),
        Key("Enter"),
        ClickAt(1500, 800),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-lower-and-middle-planes"),
        // PS21.7: Sketch 3 on the Middle Plane.
        Click(ui("feature-middle-plane")),
        Click(ui("sketch")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        Key("C"),
        ClickWorld(-12.7, 0),
        KeyDown("Shift"),
        ClickWorld(19.05, 0),
        KeyUp("Shift"),
        Type("2.5"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Key("Escape"),
        // Its centre 0.5 from the origin, Horizontal to it.
        Key("D"),
        Click(world(0, 0)),
        Click(world(-12.7, 0)),
        MoveWorld(-6.35, -45),
        Wait(2),
        Click(world(-6.35, -45)),
        Type("0.5"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Key("Escape"),
        Click(world(-12.7, 0)),
        Click(world(0, 0)),
        Key("H"),
        Click(ui("sketch-dialog-accept")),
        // PS21.8: Sketch 4 on the Lower Plane.
        Click(ui("feature-lower-plane")),
        Click(ui("sketch")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        Key("C"),
        ClickWorld(-19.05, 0),
        KeyDown("Shift"),
        ClickWorld(-12.7, 0),
        KeyUp("Shift"),
        Type("0.5"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Key("Escape"),
        // Its centre 0.75 from the origin, Horizontal to it.
        Key("D"),
        Click(world(0, 0)),
        Click(world(-19.05, 0)),
        MoveWorld(-9.525, -45),
        Wait(2),
        Click(world(-9.525, -45)),
        Type("0.75"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Key("Escape"),
        Click(world(-19.05, 0)),
        Click(world(0, 0)),
        Key("H"),
        Click(ui("sketch-dialog-accept")),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-sketches-3-and-4"),
        // PS21.9: the Loft, with the rim hidden so Sketch 2's band under it can be picked.
        RightClick(ui("part-row-part-1")),
        WaitFor("part-hide"),
        Click(ui("part-hide")),
        Click(ui("loft")),
        WaitFor("loft-dialog"),
        Click(xyz(20, 0, 0)),
        Click(xyz(0, 48.26, 0)),
        Click(ui("feature-sketch-3")),
        Click(ui("feature-sketch-4")),
        Click(ui("loft-start-condition")),
        Click(ui("loft-start-condition-option-1")),
        Click(ui("loft-start-magnitude-field")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("0.5"),
        Key("Tab"),
        Click(ui("loft-end-condition")),
        Click(ui("loft-end-condition-option-1")),
        Click(ui("loft-end-magnitude-field")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("1"),
        Key("Tab"),
        Click(ui("loft-operation-1")),
        RightClick(ui("part-row-part-1")),
        WaitFor("part-show"),
        Click(ui("part-show")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-loft-add-normal-to-profile-0-5-and-1"),
        Click(ui("loft-dialog-accept")),
        // PS21.10: Shell the loft 0.05 in, top and bottom removed.
        Click(ui("shell")),
        WaitFor("shell-dialog"),
        Click(xyz(20, 0, 0)),
        Key("Shift+6"),
        Click(xyz(-19.05, 3, -76.2)),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Click(ui("shell-thickness-field")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("0.05"),
        Key("Tab"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-shell-fails-on-the-handle"),
        Click(ui("shell-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(20),
        // PS21.11: edit the Loft (the view rolls back to it), New, then Final.
        DoubleClick(ui("feature-loft-1")),
        WaitFor("loft-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-edit-loft-rolled-back"),
        Click(ui("loft-operation-0")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-loft-new-rolled-back"),
        Click(ui("loft-final")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("11-loft-new-final-shell-works"),
        Click(ui("loft-dialog-accept")),
        // PS21.12: Boolean Union, the loft first.
        Click(ui("part-row-part-2")),
        Click(ui("part-row-part-1")),
        Click(ui("boolean")),
        WaitFor("boolean-dialog"),
        Key("Enter"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("12-boolean-union"),
        // PS21.13: Fillet R0.5 on the handle's vertical corners.
        Click(ui("fillet")),
        WaitFor("fillet-dialog"),
        Scroll(xyz(85, 0, 1.5875), 8),
        Wait(20),
        Click(xyz(55.507, -34.803, 1.5875)),
        Click(xyz(114.3, -19.05, 1.5875)),
        Key("Shift+4"),
        Click(xyz(114.3, 19.05, 1.5875)),
        Key("Shift+2"),
        Click(xyz(55.507, 34.803, 1.5875)),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Scroll(xyz(85, 0, 1.5875), 8),
        Wait(20),
        Click(ui("fillet-size-field")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("0.5"),
        Key("Tab"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("13-fillet-handle-corners"),
        Click(ui("fillet-dialog-accept")),
        Key("F"),
        // PS21.14: the bead's sketch on Front.
        Click(ui("sketch")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        Click(ui("feature-front")),
        Key("N"),
        Scroll(world(114.3, 3.175), 12),
        Wait(20),
        Key("A"),
        ClickWorld(117.475, 3.175),
        ClickWorld(111.125, 3.175),
        ClickWorld(114.3, 6.35),
        Key("Escape"),
        Key("Escape"),
        // R0.125: the sketch's first dimension scales it about the arc's centre, which stays on
        // the handle's top outer edge.
        Key("D"),
        Click(world(114.3, 6.35)),
        MoveWorld(120, 8.5),
        Wait(2),
        Click(world(120, 8.5)),
        Type("0.125"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Key("Escape"),
        Key("L"),
        ClickWorld(111.125, 3.175),
        ClickWorld(111.125, 0),
        ClickWorld(117.475, 0),
        ClickWorld(117.475, 3.175),
        Key("Escape"),
        Key("Escape"),
        // Fully defined (P3.8, the P3.7 judge): the lines tangent to the arc, the bottom line
        // level with the origin, and the arc's centre pierced by the handle's top outer edge
        // (seen from the side, where the edge is a line).
        Key("T"),
        ClickWorld(111.125, 1.5),
        ClickWorld(113.0, 6.07),
        Key("Escape"),
        Key("T"),
        ClickWorld(117.475, 1.5),
        ClickWorld(115.6, 6.07),
        Key("Escape"),
        Key("V"),
        ClickWorld(117.475, 1.5),
        Key("Escape"),
        Key("H"),
        ClickWorld(111.125, 0),
        Scroll(world(114.3, 3.175), -12),
        Wait(20),
        ClickWorld(0, 0),
        Key("Escape"),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Scroll(xyz(114.3, 0, 3.175), 12),
        Wait(20),
        Key("Shift+G"),
        ClickWorld(114.3, 3.175),
        Click(xyz(114.3, 3.5, 3.175)),
        Key("Escape"),
        Key("N"),
        Key("F"),
        Scroll(world(114.3, 3.175), 12),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("14-sketch-5-bead"),
        Click(ui("sketch-dialog-accept")),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("F"),
        // PS21.15: Sweep Add along the tangent chain (Create selection).
        Click(ui("sweep")),
        WaitFor("sweep-dialog"),
        Click(ui("feature-sketch-5")),
        Click(ui("sweep-operation-1")),
        Click(ui("sweep-path-field")),
        RightClick(at(1400, 820)),
        WaitFor("viewport-select"),
        Hover(ui("viewport-select")),
        WaitFor("viewport-create-selection"),
        Click(ui("viewport-create-selection")),
        WaitFor("create-selection-dialog"),
        Click(xyz(114.3, 0, 3.175)),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("15-create-selection-tangent-connected"),
        Click(ui("create-selection-add")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("16-sweep-bead-add"),
        Click(ui("sweep-dialog-accept")),
        // PS21.16: the spout.
        Key("Shift+6"),
        Key("Shift+E"),
        WaitFor("extrude-dialog"),
        Click(xyz(-13.35, 0, -76.2)),
        Click(ui("extrude-depth-field")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("1"),
        Click(ui("extrude-dialog-title")),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("17-spout-extrude-add-1in"),
        Key("Enter"),
        // PS21.17: the part's name and material.
        RightClick(ui("part-row-part-2")),
        WaitFor("part-rename"),
        Click(ui("part-rename")),
        WaitFor("part-rename"),
        Type("Funnel"),
        Key("Enter"),
        ClickAt(1420, 900),
        RightClick(ui("part-row-funnel")),
        WaitFor("part-material"),
        Click(ui("part-material")),
        WaitFor("material-dialog"),
        Click(ui("material-choose")),
        Type("poly"),
        Click(ui("material-item-polypropylene")),
        Click(ui("material-dialog-accept")),
        // PS21.18: Mass properties.
        ClickAt(1420, 900),
        Click(ui("part-row-funnel")),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("18-funnel-mass-properties"),
    ],
)
